# Used when the build context is csharp/ (BuildKit, podman and buildah read <Dockerfile name>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Allow list: send only what the Dockerfile copies (the later lines win), not the game client, the test assets or other projects' build output.
**
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!BannedSymbols.txt
!.editorconfig
!Unciv.Core
!Unciv.Relay
!migration/ai-spec/data
Unciv.Relay/deploy/*
!Unciv.Relay/deploy/healthcheck.sh
**/bin
**/obj
